.TH CentralClock 1x "03. Oct 2004" "Linux" "SRCP Clients"
.\"
.\"
.SH NAME
CentralClock \- clock with a station clock look
.\"
.\"
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B CentralClock
.\"
.\"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B CentralClock
is a clock looking like a station clock. The minute hand has a jump on
every full minute. In the digital model railroad controller
.I SpDrS60
it is used to show the current system time. 
.\"
.\"
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR spdrs60 (1),
.BR convertRTS (1)
.\"
.\"
.SH AUTHOR
.B CentralClock
was derived from Qt example 'aclock' (Trolltech AS,
http://www.trolltech.com/) by Stefan Preis <info@linux-modellbahn.de>
with contributions from Guido Scholz <guido.scholz@bayernline.de>.
.PP
